</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X394000014C00SC_12" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___00004AW00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>When the steering lock actuator (steering lock ECU) has been replaced, refer to the immobiliser registration procedure in the reference section.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X394000014C00SC_13" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X394000014C00SC_13_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00004AX00000">
<testtitle>Read TaSCAN Data</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), perform data monitor of the instrument panel J/B assembly (main body ECU).</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table>
<title>[System selection screen: Body → Main Body → ECU Data Monitor]</title>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.74in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.44in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="0.95in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Reference Value</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Steering Unlock SW</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Unlock/Lock</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ON / OFF</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X394000014C00SC_13_0004" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="X394000014C00SC_13_0002" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000014C00SC_13_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___00004AY00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness (Instrument Panel J/B Assembly (Main Body ECU) - Steering Lock Actuator (Steering Lock ECU))</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A161600J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect instrument panel J/B assembly (main body ECU) connector V and the steering lock actuator (steering lock ECU) connector.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance between the terminals of the vehicle side wire harness connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.53in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="0.66in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.94in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Main Body ECU - Steering Lock ECU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>V18(SLP) - 4(SLP1)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance between each terminal of the vehicle side wire harness connector and body ground.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.53in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="0.66in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.94in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Main Body ECU or Steering Lock ECU - Body Ground)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>V18 (SLP) or 4 (SLP1) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X394000014C00SC_13_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X394000014C00SC_13_0006" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000014C00SC_13_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___00004AZ00000">
<testtitle>Replace with Known Good Instrument Panel J/B Assembly (Main Body ECU)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Replace the instrument panel J/B assembly (main body ECU) with a new or known good one and perform the inspection in step 1 again.</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X394000014C00SC_13_0004" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="X394000014C00SC_13_0007" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000014C00SC_13_0004">
<testtitle>Replace Steering Lock Actuator Assembly</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000014C00SC_13_0006">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000014C00SC_13_0007">
<testtitle>OK (instrument panel J/B assembly malfunction)</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
